The source check found a material production-history error: Eason’s adaptation first played at Lookingglass in Chicago in 2008; the New Vic mounted its Theresa Heskins production in 2013. I’m correcting each affected learning check and separating house practice guidance from the AQA paper’s actual question formats.
apply patch
